+/* macOS ARM64 port: the kernel zeroes x18 on every return to user mode
+ * (interrupts, page faults, signals), so the TEB cannot be kept in x18.
+ * The unix side stores it in a fixed pthread TSD slot instead, which is
+ * addressed from TPIDRRO_EL0 (low 3 bits hold the CPU number). */
